  "description": "Proposed Installation of Air Source and Water Source Heat Pumps in basement car park. Construction of enclosure around plant.\nInstallation of 24 roof Mounted Photo Voltaic panels on Blocks 1,2 and 3. ( 8No per block )\nStripping out existing gas boilers and associated plant and equipment from boiler house.\nRemoval of existing hot water cylinders, radiators and associated pipework from Flats 1-71. Fitting new heat Interface Units (HIU ), pipework\nand new radiators.\nExcavation of trenches including breaking through existing paved and concrete paths and roads and installation of new heating pipework and\nelectricity mains supplies including associated switch gear in boiler house and in garage to serve new plant.",
